Names kept from upstream on purpose
-----------------------------------

  * `Message.from`-style field names and the `kind` union, so a row read here reads
    the same as upstream's.
  * The design comments ("Simple mode's message text: 15/22, the size whose cap
    height matches the design") — they explain why a number is that number.
  * `resolveBotAvatarOutcome` keeps upstream's note that it is mirrored by an iOS
    function of the same name.

What was deliberately left behind
---------------------------------

  * `src/state/store.tsx` (the 3,292-line reducer store), the i18n catalogue
    (`src/locales/`), feature flags, and every hook that reads them. Components here
    take props instead.
  * `enterprise/`, `electron/`, `server/`, `relay/`, `connector/`, `companion/`,
    `cloudflare/`, `apps/`, `eval*/`, `scripts/`, `deploy/` — none of it is UI.
  * Shiki / mermaid / KaTeX rendering, mention popovers, thread-ref links, link
    hover cards, attachment previews, dictation, call mode, approval mode: each
    pulls a subsystem this build does not have. See the header of the file that
    would have carried it.
